        "note": "Wikipedia links the 2024 reading of figurative geoglyphs to planned public architecture tied to pilgrimage and to the Cahuachi temples via Masini and Orefici. Press coverage of the same study describes the new figures as relief-type, smaller, and located close to winding paths, with the pilgrimage route running to Cahuachi.",
